<title>PHILIPPINES: A Soriano shareholders approve debt issue.</title>
<headline>A Soriano shareholders approve debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of A. Soriano Corp approved the issue of a 10-year $60 million convertible note issue at their annual meeting on Wednesday, officials said.</p>
<p>Details of the debt issue were not immediately available.</p>
<p>A. Soriano Corp is a holding company with interests in mining, finance, insurance, property and paper.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
